      <p class="route-card__why">Build new lines.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Firms.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Pilots.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Slow decisions.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Move toward head.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="route-card">
      <div class="route-card__top">
        <span class="route-card__n">06</span>
        <span class="chip chip--mid">Scalable with a business layer</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Consulting for founders</h3>
      <p class="route-card__why">Advise early firms.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Founders.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Case notes.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Needs credibility.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Add retainers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="route-card">
      <div class="route-card__top">
        <span class="route-card__n">07</span>
        <span class="chip chip--low">Not so scalable</span>
      </div>
